---
layout: layouts/rearrange.njk
title: 把世界重新编排
description: 书稿与日记选段交织成一张没有固定顺序的星图。经过未知、放手与未曾走过的路，回看生活里仍在变化的问题。
permalink: /stories/rearrange/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="universe-hero" aria-labelledby="universe-title">
  <div class="cosmos-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="universe-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shell universe-hero-inner">
    <p class="universe-kicker">AN OPEN MEMOIR · 2017—NOW</p>
    <h1 id="universe-title">把世界<br><em>重新编排</em></h1>
    <p class="universe-intro">过去没有说完的话，也会在新的经历里回来。一个窗口、一张评分表、一块田，或软件里的一个可选功能，都可以成为入口。</p>
    <div class="universe-invite"><span class="invite-line"></span><p>从一个让你在意的问题出发。</p><a href="#constellations">进入星图 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="constellation-section atlas-section" id="constellations" aria-labelledby="atlas-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="constellation-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW A QUESTION</p><h2 id="atlas-title">旧故事，新的回声。</h2><p>从任何一处进入。拖动星图，沿问题穿过不同年份；后来的经历也会改变早先故事的读法。</p></div>
    <div class="atlas-lenses" aria-label="选择阅读视角">
      <button class="lens-all is-selected" type="button" data-atlas-lens="all" aria-pressed="true">看整片星空</button>
      {% for lens in rearrangeAtlas.lenses %}
      <button class="lens-choice" type="button" data-atlas-lens="{{ lens.id }}" aria-pressed="false" style="--movement-color: {{ lens.color }}"><span class="lens-label">{{ lens.symbol }} {{ lens.title }}</span><span class="lens-quote">{{ lens.quote }}</span></button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="atlas-lens-status" data-lens-status aria-live="polite">这里显示当前回看时的归属；新的经历到来后，它也可以改变。</p>
    <div class="atlas-toolbar" aria-label="星图控制">
      <div class="atlas-zoom-controls"><button type="button" data-atlas-zoom-out aria-label="缩小星图">−</button><span data-atlas-zoom aria-live="polite">100%</span><button type="button" data-atlas-zoom-in aria-label="放大星图">＋</button></div>
      <button type="button" data-atlas-fit>总览</button><button type="button" data-atlas-home>初始视野</button>
      <label class="atlas-jump-label"><span class="sr-only">找到一段经历</span><select data-atlas-jump><option value="">找到一段经历…</option>{% for point in rearrangeAtlas.mapNodes %}<option value="{{ point.slug }}">{{ point.title }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></label>
      <span class="atlas-size-note">{{ rearrangeAtlas.bookCount }} 篇书稿 · {{ rearrangeAtlas.diaryCount }} 段续写</span>
    </div>
    <p class="atlas-navigation-hint" id="atlas-help">拖动移动 · 双指缩放 · Ctrl + 滚轮缩放 · 聚焦图面后可用方向键移动</p>
    <div class="atlas-map is-viewport" data-atlas-map data-world-width="{{ rearrangeAtlas.world.width }}" data-world-height="{{ rearrangeAtlas.world.height }}" data-home-x="{{ rearrangeAtlas.initialView.x }}" data-home-y="{{ rearrangeAtlas.initialView.y }}" data-home-focus="{{ rearrangeAtlas.initialFocus }}" tabindex="0" aria-label="可拖动缩放的关系星图" aria-describedby="atlas-help">
      <div class="cosmos-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="atlas-world" data-atlas-world style="width: {{ rearrangeAtlas.world.width }}px; height: {{ rearrangeAtlas.world.height }}px;">
      <svg class="atlas-edges" viewBox="0 0 {{ rearrangeAtlas.world.width }} {{ rearrangeAtlas.world.height }}" aria-hidden="true">
        {% for edge in rearrangeAtlas.edges %}<line x1="{{ edge.x1 }}" y1="{{ edge.y1 }}" x2="{{ edge.x2 }}" y2="{{ edge.y2 }}" data-atlas-edge data-from="{{ edge.from }}" data-to="{{ edge.to }}"/>{% endfor %}
      </svg>
      {% for point in rearrangeAtlas.mapNodes %}
      <a class="atlas-star{% if point.kind == 'diary' %} atlas-star-diary{% endif %}" href="{{ point.href | relativeUrl(page.url) }}" style="--x: {{ point.x }}px; --y: {{ point.y }}px; --movement-color: {{ point.movementInfo.color }};" data-map-node="{{ point.slug }}" data-node-x="{{ point.x }}" data-node-y="{{ point.y }}" data-lenses="{{ point.lenses | join(',') }}" data-atlas-title="{{ point.title }}" data-atlas-note="{{ point.question }}" data-atlas-reading="{{ point.currentReading.note }}" aria-label="{{ point.title }}：{{ point.question }}"><span class="atlas-star-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="atlas-star-text"><small>{{ '日记重编 · ' ~ point.era if point.kind == 'diary' else point.era }}</small><strong>{{ point.title }}</strong>{% if point.readings.length > 1 %}<small class="atlas-history-note">读法曾改变</small>{% endif %}</span></a>
      {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <noscript><div class="atlas-noscript-list">{% for point in rearrangeAtlas.mapNodes %}<a href="{{ point.href | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">{{ point.title }}</a>{% endfor %}</div></noscript>
    <div class="atlas-caption"><div><strong data-atlas-caption-title>从一个让你在意的问题出发</strong><p data-atlas-caption-note>将鼠标移到一颗星上，或用键盘聚焦它，看看它和哪里相连。</p></div><p data-story-progress></p></div>
    <div class="map-colophon"><p>书稿里的经历经过删并与重排。每周日记经改写与合并进入约一到两个新点，也可以让旧点重新归类。</p><button type="button" data-story-reset>清空本机足迹</button></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="reading-note shell"><span class="reading-note-mark" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><div><p class="eyebrow">AN OPEN ARCHIVE</p><h2>生活还在继续，路径也可以改变。</h2><p>三句话出自 T. S. Eliot《四个四重奏》的《东库克》。它们与书稿、新的日记选段放在一起，由每次回看产生新的联系。这里的选择改变阅读路径，事件本身仍按它发生时的样子留下。</p></div></section>
